# Dependencies
node_modules/
yarn.lock
# package-lock.json IS tracked here (unlike in the monorepo, where the workspace
# root's single lockfile covers this package): this mirror is its own package
# root, and `npm ci` (used in CI) needs a lockfile to exist at all.

